Z||000000||Pheagey||10-10-2001||03:11 PM||||Hey there. My lil ol' '88 coupe is hard to start. It was not always like this. IT has gradually ground worse over the last few months. I plan on changing th plugs and wires ASAP. Couple it be the fuel pump? Anyways thanks.||||reg||1
