Z||000006||JohnF||10-11-2001||10:43 AM||||Hard (no) starting is a real tough analysis.  With my Tech 4, I replaced everything in the ignition system (have $900 in bill to prove it!).  Still hard starting.  Turned out the coil(s) were still NFG.  Again, I replaced them and 50K later my '88 still starts and runs like new!||||reg||1
